Conditions for distributing binaries

A program built with spinelbpf contains the C loader of bpf-mlir-loader, which
links libelf statically. This repository distributes source only. If you
distribute such a binary, the conditions in the NOTICE of bpf-mlir-loader
(libelf under LGPL-3.0, libbpf under BSD-2-Clause, zlib) apply to it.

